  }
}

### Conflict demo: same event_id, different payload -> 409 --------------------
POST {{host}}/v1/results/training
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "event_id": "train_20261013043353_8cef49:300:2:training:candidate_ready:v1",
  "event_type": "training.completed",
  "entity_id": "300:2",
  "payload": { "status": "candidate_ready", "metrics": { "mae": 9.99 } }
}

### Reads ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/v1/results/training?entity_id=300:2&limit=10

###
GET {{host}}/v1/results/backtest?entity_id=300:2&backtest_type=policy_replay

###
GET {{host}}/v1/results/scoring?entity_id=300:2&since=2026-10-13T00:00:00Z&limit=100

###
GET {{host}}/v1/results/entities/300:2

###
GET {{host}}/v1/results/events/train_20261013043353_8cef49:300:2:training:candidate_ready:v1


### ==========================================================================
### SENDER SIDE - Cart Result Publisher (durable outbox), default port 8300
### ==========================================================================

@pub = http://127.0.0.1:8300

### Publisher health: queue depth, worker state, receiver target -------------
GET {{pub}}/health

### Enqueue an event for durable delivery (202 queued, 200 duplicate) --------
POST {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "train_20261013043353_8cef49:300:2:training:candidate_ready:v1",
  "event_type": "training.completed",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "occurred_at": "2026-10-13T04:33:53.120Z",
  "entity_id": "300:2",
  "site_key": "177",
  "upload_id": "upl_20261013_002b9ca1",
  "job_id": "train_20261013043353_8cef49",
  "model_id": "mdl_300_2_20261013035036_c1f270",
  "payload": {
    "status": "candidate_ready",
    "config_hash": "549777393e8a3846",
    "metrics": { "mae": 3.41, "rmse": 5.02, "rows": 18420 }
  }
}

### Same event_id again -> 200 duplicate_suppressed, nothing queued twice ----
POST {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "train_20261013043353_8cef49:300:2:training:candidate_ready:v1",
  "event_type": "training.completed",
  "entity_id": "300:2",
  "payload": { "status": "candidate_ready" }
}

### Queue state: counts, worker_running, recent events -----------------------
GET {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox

###
GET {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox?status=dead_letter&limit=20

###
GET {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox?entity_id=300:2&event_type=training.completed

### One queued event with its delivery history ------------------------------
GET {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox/train_20261013043353_8cef49:300:2:training:candidate_ready:v1

### Deliver a batch now, without waiting for the worker ----------------------
POST {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox/flush

### Requeue every dead letter, then flush ------------------------------------
POST {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Requeue one dead letter --------------------------------------------------
POST {{pub}}/v1/integrations/outbox/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{ "event_id": "train_20261013043353_8cef49:300:2:training:candidate_ready:v1" }
